<component><section><templateId root="2.16.840.1.113883.10.20.22.2.17" extension="2015-08-01"/><code code="29762-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Social history Narrative"/><title>Social History</title><text><list><item>Occupation: first-term state legislator, also writing a naval history; long days in session and frequent public speaking [S]</item><item>Never smoker; does not vape; drinks alcohol rarely; no drug use [S]</item><item>Exercise: boxes three times a week, rows, and takes long hill walks most weekends; believes hard training is what controls his asthma [S]</item><item>Lives in an older city apartment with wall-to-wall carpet; no pets; no visible mold; no workplace fumes or dusts [S]</item><item>Supports: close friends, a boxing coach, and colleagues at work [S]</item></list></text></section></component>

